OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh county becomes global
OL,4,Ahotspot for carbon emissions after
OL,5,Awildfires
OL,6,
OL,7,FA county in Wales had one of the
OL,8,Fworld's highest carbon emissions per
OL,9,Fsquare kilometre due to wildfires in
OL,10,FJuly, according to a charity.
OL,12,FThe fire above Blaenavon, Torfaen was
OL,13,Fdescribed as "one of the largest and
OL,14,Fmost challenging" in south Wales in
OL,15,Frecent years by the fire service.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
