OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh county becomes global
OL,4,Ahotspot for carbon emissions after
OL,5,Awildfires
OL,6,
OL,7,FSave the Children said it was concerned
OL,8,Fabout possible health consequences
OL,9,Fafter data, external published by the
OL,10,FEuropean Union's earth observation
OL,11,Fprogramme, Copernicus, showed Torfaen
OL,12,Fbehind Malanje in Angola, Spain's Avila
OL,13,Fand Annaba in Algeria in terms of
OL,14,Fwildfire emissions in July.
OL,16,FTorfaen council said it was unaware of
OL,17,Fthe EU data but its own air quality
OL,18,Fmonitoring showed "elevated particulate
OL,19,Fconcentrations".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
